WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.331 --> 00:00:01.669
- It tastes green.

00:00:01.669 --> 00:00:03.382
Does that make any sense?

00:00:03.382 --> 00:00:06.882
(slinky electronic music)

00:01:01.124 --> 00:01:03.065
- Mm, I like that one.

00:01:03.065 --> 00:01:04.427
- Like got a good texture to it.

00:01:04.427 --> 00:01:06.481
- They are a little bit nuttier
and a little bit creamier.

00:01:06.481 --> 00:01:09.145
- It's dense, it's fudge-y,
just what you want in a brownie.

00:01:09.145 --> 00:01:11.166
- You can definitely tell
they're not as sweet.

00:01:11.166 --> 00:01:13.258
- If somebody handed this out at a party,

00:01:13.258 --> 00:01:14.347
I would have no clue.

00:01:14.347 --> 00:01:16.338
- I don't really taste
avocado, I can just tell

00:01:16.338 --> 00:01:17.435
something's up with them.

00:01:17.435 --> 00:01:20.058
- Has in aftertaste, of shrimp,

00:01:20.058 --> 00:01:20.891
(vinyl record scratching)

00:01:20.891 --> 00:01:22.979
there's a shrimp-y aftertaste.

00:01:22.979 --> 00:01:24.082
I'm not kidding here.

00:01:24.082 --> 00:01:26.990
- All together, they're
delicious either way.

00:01:26.990 --> 00:01:29.806
- I think it's because you
mentioned it, I taste this,

00:01:29.806 --> 00:01:30.790
taste like fish now.

00:01:30.790 --> 00:01:32.903
If you hadn't said anything,
it would just taste

00:01:32.903 --> 00:01:34.458
like the color green.

00:01:34.458 --> 00:01:36.510
- I could deal with these
if I want to feel healthier.

00:01:36.510 --> 00:01:39.790
- I mean, it's a damn brownie,
how could you not love it?

00:01:39.790 --> 00:01:42.443
- I say it tastes like it
could possibly have weed in it.

00:01:42.443 --> 00:01:43.825
I've never had a weed brownie, but--

00:01:43.825 --> 00:01:47.992
- It tastes nothing like
a weed brownie. (laughing)

